  "title": "The Spilled Juice",
  "source": "original",
  "text": "Nina fills her cup all the way to the top with grape juice. She bumps the table while reaching for a napkin. The cup tips over, and purple juice spills across the floor. Nina grabs a towel because she made the mess. She wipes the floor until it is clean and dry again. Next time, Nina fills her cup only halfway.",
